		\n	\n				\n				\n				\n				\n									The Friday Social is your new favor
	ite way to kick off the weekend. Join us at Ruki’s Kitchen for an elevated
	 happy hour celebrating bold Ethiopian cuisine\, global flavors\, and grea
	t company. In partnership with Stella Artois\, enjoy complimentary beer fr
	om the iconic Stella Artois Airstream\, exclusive swag\, live music from a
	 DJ\, and an inviting atmosphere designed to help you unwind after the wor
	kweek. Whether you’re gathering with coworkers or meeting friends\, The Fr
	iday Social is the perfect place to experience international flavors\, con
	nect with your community\, and start your weekend on a high note.   						
